    <description><![CDATA[
EON Studios Swing 2 — 16-pad drum sampler for REAPER.

Includes the Swing JSFX, the Kit Bridge companion script, the sample browser, and four factory drum kits (707, 808, 909, Linn Drum).

ReaImGui is required for the sample browser — install separately from cfillion's repository.
    ]]></description>
