  <category name="EON/Swing">
    <reapack name="Swing_ReaKit.jsfx" type="effect" desc="EON Swing 2 — 16-pad drum sampler">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[
16-pad drum sampler for REAPER with multi-out routing, kit save/load (.swing format), per-pad ADSR/FX/colors, an integrated sample browser, and four factory drum kits.

After install, restart REAPER. The Swing Kit Bridge auto-registers as a startup action on first run; manually launch it once from the Action List ("Swing_Kit_Bridge.lua") to set up auto-start.

Requires ReaImGui for the sample browser (install separately via cfillion's repository).
        ]]></description>
        <link rel="website">https://eonaudio.pro</link>
      </metadata>
      <version name="2.1.5" author="EON Studios" time="2026-05-14T12:00:00Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[
Pad name widening, cross-thread race fix, empty-pad default color.

- Pad names widened from 16 to 32 characters (gmem layout updated).
- Fixed pad names not updating after multi-drag or kit load: added
  kit_busy + CMD gates on @block PADNAME mirror and @gfx sync to
  prevent cross-thread clobbering during import.
- Browser sample load (CMD 63/64): direct cname-to-gmem write +
  immediate auto-color derive for same-frame browser update.
- Empty pads now show default theme color on multi-out tracks,
  browser, and mixer (was showing hue-based color on empty pads).
- Reverb DSP: pre-delay clamping, frozen-tail buffer allocation,
  coefficient recalc moved out of @sample.
- 808 auto-load guard: prevents hot-reload from overwriting user kit.
- Filename categorizer: strip leading digits/underscores for cleaner
  pad display names.
        ]]></changelog>

